@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = 여기에_토큰_붙여넣기
@workspaceId = 여기에_워크스페이스id_붙여넣기
@targetUserId = 여기에_대상_유저id_붙여넣기

### 멤버 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 멤버 Presence 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 권한 변경 (OWNER → ADMIN 승격)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### 권한 변경 (ADMIN → MEMBER 강등)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### 멤버 추방 — 204 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 자기 자신 추방 시도 — 400 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/내_userId_직접입력
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### OWNER 추방 시도 — 403 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members/owner_userId_직접입력
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
